{"generated":"2026-10-30T23:49:00.157Z","category":"leveling","pages":[{"id":"leveling/gear-ladder","title":"Gear ladder 10 to 35","category":"leveling","as_of":"2026-10-18","checked":"2026-10-26","status":"current","confidence":"likely","facts":[{"key":"mage_quest_gear.level_10","value":"Ley or Arcane Staff (+1 Int, +1 Spi, +2 SP) or Ley or Arcane Orb (Use: 80 to 240 mana, 30 min cooldown); Horde Boughs in the Wind adds Windbough Wand (7.19 DPS, +1 Int, item level 10)","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/level-30-dps-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S11","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1861","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S24","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9513","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"mage_quest_gear.level_15","value":"Manaweave Robe or Lesser Spellfire Robes, +6 Int, ilvl 20","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/level-30-dps-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S17","url":"https://www.warcrafttavern.com/forever/guides/mage-leveling/","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S24","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9513","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"mage_quest_gear.level_26","value":"Astral Knot Robe (+6 Sta, +6 Int, +6 Spi) or Blouse (+6 Sta, +9 Int), Nether-lace versions on Horde, ilvl 31","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/level-30-dps-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S17","url":"https://www.warcrafttavern.com/forever/guides/mage-leveling/","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S24","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9513","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"mage_quest_gear.level_30","value":"Mage's Wand chain ending in the Scarlet Library: Icefury (41 to 78 Frost, +3 Int, +9 Frost SP), Ragefire (+9 Fire SP) or Nether Force (+9 Arcane SP), about 37 DPS each","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/level-30-dps-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S24","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9513","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"mage_quest_steps.level_10","value":"Alliance: Speak with Belann, then Mirror Lake (1861), The Balnir Farmstead or Mage-tastic Gizmonitor; Horde: Speak with Un'thuwa, then Boughs in the Wind (93797) or Ju-Ju Heaps","refs":[{"id":"S11","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1861","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"class_quest_gear.other_classes","value":"priest 10 and 20 quests teach racial spells with no gear; shaman totem quests give no stats; the shaman Tempest's Weapons, warlock Soran'ruk and paladin level 20 weapons are on their class pages","refs":[{"id":"S15","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/level-30-healer-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S3","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/level-30-healer-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S4","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/level-30-dps-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S12","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/level-30-tank-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"leatherworking.totemic_leather","value":"BoP healer leather: Moonglow Boots 10, Gloves 15, Tunic 22, Helm 25 (+13 Sta, +12 SP), Leggings 25, Skycaller's Belt 30 (+6 Sta, +6 Int, +4 Spi, +10 SP); recipe sources not found","refs":[{"id":"S3","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/shaman/restoration/level-30-healer-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S9","url":"https://nether.wowhead.com/forever/tooltip/item/252456","host":"nether.wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"blacksmithing.favor_mail","value":"Crusader's Chain Belt (skill 45), Gloves (80), Boots (85), Silvered Chain Helm (95), Shirt (110), Leggings (125), 30 Merchant's Favor each, no rep gate; Protector's is the Defense variant","refs":[{"id":"S7","url":"https://www.wow-professions.com/forever/merchants-favor-durotar-supply-azeroth-commerce","host":"wow-professions.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"crafted_caster_staves.levels","value":"Glimmering Staff and Orb of Mystic Insight at 25, Radiant Staff at 45 (Enchanting, BoP); stats on the Enchanting page","refs":[{"id":"S8","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=249392","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S1","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/mage/fire/level-30-dps-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"wands.crafted_vendor_price","value":"1 copper from Oct 1; Enchanting wands repriced Oct 8 (Lesser Magic Wand 1s 10c, Greater Magic Wand 2s)","refs":[{"id":"S10","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-october-15/2360696","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"wand_ladder.5_to_13","value":"Lesser Magic Wand (5, about 11.3 DPS, +1 SP) and Greater Magic Wand (13, about 17.5 DPS, +2 SP), Enchanting BoE","refs":[{"id":"S1","u