_stat_priority","value":"contested: Wowhead's beta author values Strength and spell power with Defense poor early; Icy Veins lists Stamina, Spell Power, Strength, Block, Hit, Defense","refs":[{"id":"S12","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/level-30-tank-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S14","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/protection-paladin-tank-pve-guide","host":"icy-veins.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"tank_shields_under_35","value":"Mirror of Rath'mael (19), Seedcloud Buckler (19), Bonepile Gaze (28), Painwalker Buckler (29)","refs":[{"id":"S12","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/level-30-tank-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S20","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/paladin/protection/level-20-tank-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S21","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Ruins_of_Lordaeron_(instance)","host":"warcraft.wiki.gg","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S22","url":"https://conquestcapped.com/guides/wow-forever/wow-forever-city-of-dalaran-guide/","host":"conquestcapped.com","tier":3,"label":"forum or datamine","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S24","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9513","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"healer_stat_order.guides","value":"Healing Power, Intellect, MP5, Spirit, Crit per Warcraft Tavern; Wowhead's Discipline guide (Oct 6) says look for Spell Power, Healing Power, Intellect and Spirit, with no ranking and no mention of crit","refs":[{"id":"S15","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/priest/discipline/level-30-healer-overview","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S23","url":"https://www.warcrafttaver