ce Oct 8, matching Classic Era, not the highest member's","refs":[{"id":"S2","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-october-15/2360696","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"party_xp.kill_split","value":"kill XP split among nearby living members; quest turn-in XP unaffected by grouping; raid groups get no quest credit; exact split unpublished","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://www.warcrafttavern.com/forever/guides/experience/","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"party_xp.outlevel","value":"no XP for anyone if one member vastly outlevels the mob (Blizzard's Oct 8 developers' note, \"as intended\")","refs":[{"id":"S2","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-october-15/2360696","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S11","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/news/blizzard-reveals-how-leveling-will-work-in-wow-forever/","host":"icy-veins.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-18"}]},{"key":"dungeon_xp.quest_bonus","value":"bonus XP on dungeon quests reduced 50% on Oct 1; base quest XP unchanged","refs":[{"id":"S2","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-october-15/2360696","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"dungeon_xp.creature","value":"dungeon creature XP up about 20% on Oct 8","refs":[{"id":"S2","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-october-15/2360696","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"dungeon_xp.trash_pre_oct_8","value":"beta players called trash XP near zero before the Oct 8 bump; no post-Oct 8 figures","refs":[{"id":"S8","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/news/wow-forever-players-are-leveling-solo-because-grouping-slows-quests-down/","host":"icy-veins.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"dungeon_xp.design_target","value":"optimal dungeon leveling close to optimal questing; dungeon-cleaving to 60 fails the design pillars (Aggrend, Oct 8)","refs":[{"id":"S9","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/the-wow-forever-podcast-episode-3-dive-into-dungeons-with-devs-ft-hammerdancegaming/2376010/20","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"dungeon_xp.after_oct_8","value":"one Oct 18 thread says dungeons still trail questing; no staff reply","refs":[{"id":"S10","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2386463","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":3,"label":"forum or datamine","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"dungeon_xp.repeat_clears","value":"pay less (guide site)","refs":[{"id":"S13","url":"https://www.zockify.com/forever/dungeons/","host":"zockify.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"aoe_farming.status","value":"Blizzard tuned against mass-pull AoE leveling; small open-world pulls still work per guides; no Forever AoE farm spot with XP per hour has been posted","refs":[{"id":"S2","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-october-15/2360696","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S1","url":"https://www.warcrafttavern.com/forever/guides/experience/","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"respawn.starter_zones","value":"faster respawns in Elwynn, Dun Morogh, Durotar, Mulgore and Westfall since Sep 24","refs":[{"id":"S2","url":"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-october-15/2360696","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]}],"open":["The exact party kill XP split.","Any 1 to 60 time: level 30 is about 13% of the XP to 60, so no credible figure exists.","Whether the quest log figure and the no-boost line appear in Blizzard's own text."],"aliases":["hours to level","how long it takes","time to 60","/played","leveling speed","level fast","max level"],"blurb":"The XP curve is Classic's, 4,084,700 to 60 with no global buff; Blizzard changed the world instead, with 1,000+ new quests. Rested XP works as in Classic and cooked food adds a small bonus.","related":["dungeons/overview","leveling/zones","leveling/gear-ladder","dungeons/excavation-site-wetlands","systems/camping-objects","systems/legacy","systems/legacy-perks","classes/mage"],"history":[{"date":"2026-10-30","text":"Fixed: (fix round, plain answers for newcomers): aliases level fast and max level. No fact changed."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"Rechecked: 19 facts hold, 1 unsupported in its snapshot, 2 pending (S8, S11); no XP tuning published after the Oct 15 notes."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"Rechecked: party_xp.outlevel was \"(guide read of the notes) [S11]\" with S11 dead, source says Blizzard's own Oct 8 developers' note: if a party member is at a vastly higher level than the enemy, no one in the party receives XP, as intended (S2). global buff now also cites S7 (Timesaver: same original curve, no global XP buff). Both Open bullets resolved."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"migrated from library topics 05 and 07; Camp Tent and dungeon quest XP wording corrected per LIBRARY-GAPS (2026-10-26, cluster C)."}],"recheck_days":7,"snapshots":[{"id":"S1","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"sha8":"a0cdcaa2","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S2","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"sha8":"98ca929e","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S3","host":"news.blizzard.com","tier":1,"sha8":"72f4e879","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S4","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"sha8":"da47e038","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S5","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"sha8":"5166f5f9","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S6","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":3,"sha8":"26438466","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S7","host":"timesaver.gg","tier":2,"sha8":"c097dbc4","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S8","host":"icy-veins.com","tier":2,"sha8":"00f7d826","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S9","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":1,"sha8":"94224e90","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S10","host":"us.forums.blizzard.com","tier":3,"sha8":"b0472346","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S11","host":"icy-veins.com","tier":2,"sha8":"none","accessed":"2026-10-18"},{"id":"S12","host":"news.blizzard.com","tier":1,"sha8":"21346b11","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S13","host":"zockify.com","tier":2,"sha8":"1f93364c","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S14","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"sha8":"e97e3493","accessed":"2026-10-26"}],"blizzard":9},{"id":"leveling/zones","title":"Leveling zones","category":"leveling","as_of":"2026-10-20","checked":"2026-10-29","status":"current","confidence":"confirmed","facts":[{"key":"new_zones.list","value":"Zephras Isle, Riverglades, Shen'dralas, Mount Hyjal new; Wetlands and Desolace updated","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24303862/world-of-warcraft-forever-whats-next-panel-recap","host":"news.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S2","url":"https://endgametools.com/en/wow-forever/news/wow-forever-leveling-zones","host":"endgametools.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"zephras_isle.level_range","value":"1 to 12 per Blizzard; one guide says 13 or 14","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24303862/world-of-warcraft-forever-whats-next-panel-recap","host":"news.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S2","url":"https://endgametools.com/en/wow-forever/news/wow-forever-leveling-zones","host":"endgametools.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026