ested for PvP per a guide)","refs":[{"id":"S1","url":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24303862/world-of-warcraft-forever-whats-next-panel-recap","host":"news.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S4","url":"https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/leveling/","host":"theforeverera.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S2","url":"https://endgametools.com/en/wow-forever/news/wow-forever-leveling-zones","host":"endgametools.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"dalaran.zone","value":"Alterac Mountains, with its own dungeon","refs":[{"id":"S2","url":"https://endgametools.com/en/wow-forever/news/wow-forever-leveling-zones","host":"endgametools.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"leveling_guides.coverage","value":"RestedXP 1 to 35 (free to 20, paid after); Guidelime TUGs to 30; no tested 30 to 60 route exists","refs":[{"id":"S6","url":"https://kami-labs.fr/en/wow-forever/restedxp-wow-forever-guide-leveling/","host":"kami-labs.fr","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S4","url":"https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/leveling/","host":"theforeverera.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S10","url":"https://kami-labs.fr/en/wow-forever/addons-leveling-wow-forever/","host":"kami-labs.fr","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S11","url":"https://wowforeverguides.com/addons","host":"wowforeverguides.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"leveling_sketch.horde","value":"1 to 10 Durotar, Tirisfal or Mulgore; 10 to 20 Barrens or Silverpine; 20 to 30 Stonetalon, Ashenvale, Hillsbrad, Thousand Needles, Desolace; 30 to 35 Stranglethorn, Arathi, Desolace (guide sketch of the Classic skeleton)","refs":[{"id":"S4","url":"https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/leveling/","host":"theforeverera.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S6","url":"https://kami-labs.fr/en/wow-forever/restedxp-wow-forever-guide-leveling/","host":"kami-labs.fr","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"leveling_sketch.alliance","value":"1 to 10 Elwynn, Dun Morogh or Teldrassil; 10 to 20 Westfall, Loch Modan or Darkshore then Redridge; 20 to 30 Duskwood, Wetlands, Ashenvale or Stonetalon, Hillsbrad; 30 to 35 northern Stranglethorn, Arathi, Desolace (guide sketch)","refs":[{"id":"S4","url":"https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/leveling/","host":"theforeverera.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S6","url":"https://kami-labs.fr/en/wow-forever/restedxp-wow-forever-guide-leveling/","host":"kami-labs.fr","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"leveling_sketch.35_plus","value":"35 to 45 Riverglades, Tanaris, Feralas; 45 to 55 Hinterlands, Searing Gorge, Azshara, Un'Goro, Felwood, Burning Steppes, Western Plaguelands; 55 to 60 Eastern Plaguelands, Winterspring, Silithus, Mount Hyjal (all theory)","refs":[{"id":"S4","url":"https://theforeverera.com/en/guides/leveling/","host":"theforeverera.com","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"travel.alliance_boats","value":"Stormwind Harbor to Auberdine (new per Method); Auberdine, Menethil, Southshore loop one way; Menethil to Theramore unchanged","refs":[{"id":"S5","url":"https://www.method.gg/wow-forever/all-travel-routes-in-wow-forever-boats-zeppelins","host":"method.gg","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"travel.neutral_boats","value":"Ratchet to Booty Bay unchanged; Steamwheedle Port to Powderfuse Port new","refs":[{"id":"S5","url":"https://www.method.gg/wow-forever/all-travel-routes-in-wow-forever-boats-zeppelins","host":"method.gg","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"travel.horde_zeppelins","value":"Orgrimmar to Undercity, Orgrimmar to Grom'gol, Undercity to Grom'gol, listed without change","refs":[{"id":"S5","url":"https://www.method.gg/wow-forever/all-travel-routes-in-wow-forever-boats-zeppelins","host":"method.gg","tier":2,"label":"guide","accessed":"2026-10-26"}]},{"key":"world.new_quests","value":"more than 1,000 new quests across the level 1 to 60 world (Oct 29 returning-player guide)","refs":[{"id":"S14","url":"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24315643","host":"worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com","tier":1,"label":"Blizzard","accessed":"2026-10-29"}]}],"open":["riverglades.level_range: S2's beta Group Finder shows 33 to 54 against Blizzard's mid-30s to mid-40s.","Shen'dralas level range: nothing published anywhere.","The Riverglades land road (sources disagree)."],"aliases":[],"blurb":"Four zones are new (Zephras Isle, Riverglades, Shen'dralas, Mount Hyjal) and two were reworked (Wetlands, Desolace).","related":["leveling/xp","dungeons/new-dungeons-35-plus","dungeons/city-of-dalaran","raids/hyjal-summit","raids/barrow-deeps","systems/gold-and-riding","systems/reputations"],"history":[{"date":"2026-10-29","text":"ADD (library loop): new quests from Blizzard's Oct 29 returning-player guide (S14); the new zone list in new_zones.list matches the guide."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"Rechecked: dungeon was \"Krol'dok Stronghold\" cited to S1 (which lists the dungeon without a zone), source now says Krol'dok Stronghold sits in the Riverglades at levels 40 to 45 for five players (S8, Blizzard's Oct 20 dungeon article)."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"migrated from library topics 07 and 19."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"Rechecked: update was \"Whelgar's Excavation storyline and the Excavation Site dungeon [S2]\", source says the Excavation Site sits above Whelgar's Excavation (S8, Blizzard); the storyline wording stays as a guide paraphrase."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"Rechecked: beta was \"never in the beta [S2]\", source says the cap rose to 30 on Oct 1 and stayed for the rest of the beta (S12) while the Group Finder lists the zone from 33 (S2), so it was out of reach rather than absent."},{"date":"2026-10-26","text":"Rechecked: mount_hyjal.role was \"new, neutral\", source says both factions share its two flight points, the Summit of Eternity and the Tainted Foothills (S2), and S4 lists the zone as Contested. Added S9 (Blizzard shop page: Heroic Pack or higher for Zephras Isle, new fact zephras_isle.pack_tier), S10 (Kami Labs addons, Oct 11: Guidelime 6.000 to 6.003 with initial Forever support, TUGs 12 to 30), S11 (WoW Forever Guides addons: Guidelime 005), S12 and S13 (WoW Forever Guides reputations: Desolace centaur factions get more quests and faction rewards). Six Open bullets resolved, zero still unsupported."}],"recheck_days":7,"snapshots":[{"id":"S1","host":"news.blizzard.com","tier":1,"sha8":"21346b11","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S2","host":"endgametools.com","tier":2,"sha8":"e33e85e8","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S3","host":"warcraft.wiki.gg","tier":2,"sha8":"e189db7c","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S4","host":"theforeverera.com","tier":2,"sha8":"62bf3f72","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S5","host":"method.gg","tier":2,"sha8":"a06e7bfc","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S6","host":"kami-labs.fr","tier":2,"sha8":"e84bbe42","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S7","host":"wowhead.com","tier":2,"sha8":"32c9bc69","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S8","host":"worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com","tier":1,"sha8":"ee9a0fa6","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S9","host":"us.shop.battle.net","tier":1,"sha8":"478a9c4b","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S10","host":"kami-labs.fr","tier":2,"sha8":"e6cbe098","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S11","host":"wowforeverguides.com","tier":2,"sha8":"be26f38a","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S12","host":"warcrafttavern.com","tier":2,"sha8":"eb0f5784","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S13","host":"wowforeverguides.com","tier":2,"sha8":"3930c781","accessed":"2026-10-26"},{"id":"S14","host":"worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com","tier":1,"sha8":"fc9ba470","accessed":"2026-10-29"}],"blizzard":10}]}
